  orcid:0000-0002-1267-0234 foaf:name "Tobias Kuhn" .
  
  <https://w3id.org/np/RAAK7zq9m5XHQaPZSfWxIS8coE-FJn9PWn43Qa8_sv6Tk> nt:hasLabelFromApi
      "Defining a new class - <p>Such a nanopublication defines a new class. Classes represent sets of conc..." .
  
  <https://w3id.org/np/RAENlitA6jHNR8Mk3PI2nA9f4mSaP3d5zH60aETdcW-uE/get-classes-of-ontology-from-space-members>
    nt:hasLabelFromApi "Get the classes of an ontology from space members including namespace - Like 'Get the classes of an ontology', but only returns classes published by an admin, maintainer, or member of the space that maintains the given resource. Classes are included if their definition declares them part of the given ontology (dct:isPartOf, or the legacy dct:partOf) or if their IRI starts with the ontology's namespace (optional 'ontologyNamespace' parameter). Each class URI appears once, kept from the latest member-published definition." .
  
